# caption: Read back a finite acyclic term graph, rejecting cyclic tree unfolding.

REQUIRE valid node IDs, ordered arity-correct children, root
ENSURE unfolded tree or cycle diagnostic
FUNCTION Unfold(n,active)
  IF n in active THEN
    reject cyclic unfolding
  END IF
  add n to the path-local active set
  IF n is an indirection THEN
    return unfolding of its target
  END IF
  recursively unfold children with this active set
  return labeled tree node containing those child trees
END FUNCTION

